---
name: changelog-line
description: Turn a merged pull request title into one changelog line. Use for "add a changelog line". Do NOT use for release notes.
---

# changelog-line

1. Read the pull request title and number.
2. Put the line under Added, Changed, or Fixed.
3. Write `- <sentence in past tense> (#<number>)`.
4. Return the section name and the line.
